|_  src=@t
++  grab
  |%
  ++  mime  |=([p=mite q=octs] q.q)      ::  from Unix on |commit
  ++  noun  @t
  ++  txt   of-wain:format
  --
++  grow
  |%
  ++  mime  [/text/x-jibb (as-octs:mimes:html src)]
  ++  txt   (to-wain:format src)
  ++  noun  src
  --
++  grad  %txt                           ::  line diffs and merges, as %hoon does
